<title>USA: Liberty Property exercises over-allotment.</title>
<headline>Liberty Property exercises over-allotment.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Property Trust said Wednesday in connection with its public offering of 7,500,000 common shares of beneficial interest which closed on March 24, 1997, the underwriters of the public offering exercised an over-allotment option to acquire 750,000 additional common shares of beneficial interest.</p>
<p>The additional net proceeds of $17,460,000 realized from the exercise of the over-allotment option increases the total net proceeds of the public offering to $191,310,000.</p>
